        <mxCell id="wc_note" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Not Terraform: users (make cognito-users), config.js + upload (make web-chat-sync), URL (make web-chat-url). Tower's TOWER_JWKS_URL, TOWER_JWT_ISSUER and&lt;br&gt;TOWER_JWT_CLIENT_IDS come from modules/cognito. Local: compose web-chat on 127.0.0.1:8083 serves page and agent, sign-in stub, no Cognito, no proxy.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
