        <mxCell id="s6_dev" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Step 6 — make deploy — terraform apply&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#9A6A1C&quot;&gt;TODO(human) build-log/13: make deploy ENV=aws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot; face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;make deploy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;one command; chains steps 7–9&lt;br&gt;(outputs → register-gateway →&lt;br&gt;seed-aws → outputs)&lt;br&gt;slow parts: CloudFront, ACM&lt;br&gt;DNS validation, ECS service steady&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DDF3EF;strokeColor=#2BB3A0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
